# Victory - The Hero's Triumph
# Celebration cutscene with credits and acknowledgments

@backdrop textures/forest.gif [fadeIn=1200]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char ELDER sprite=characters/female
@char KNIGHT sprite=npc/air-knight

@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

wait 1500

# Victory Celebration

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
We did it...
The kingdom is finally at peace.
"""

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=600]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/castle.gif [fadeIn=800]

ELDER: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
The people celebrate in the streets!
You've given them hope, hero.
"""

wait 600

KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The Elemental Guardians send their regards.
You've earned their eternal respect.
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=center]
"""
This adventure taught me so much.
Passion. Adaptation. Endurance. Freedom.
These are the true treasures.
"""

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=800]

wait 800

@backdrop textures/temple.gif [fadeIn=1000]
@do playBgm [name=audio/lonely-mountain.mp3]

# Reflections

*ELDER: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
What will you do now, hero?
With the Dark Lord sealed...
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=center]
"""
There are always more adventures.
More people who need help.
A hero's work is never done!
"""

wait 800

KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The world is vast and full of wonder.
May your journey continue forever.
"""

wait 1000

@transition wipe [duration=700]

wait 700

@backdrop textures/room.gif [fadeIn=900]

# Credits

wait 500

ELDER: [expression=neutral,position=center]
"""
THE ELEMENTAL TRIALS

A PixoSpritz Engine Showcase
"""

wait 1500

KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=center]
"""
Featuring:
- 4 Elemental Chambers
- Epic Boss Battle
- Dynamic Lighting
- Particle Effects
- Multiple Game Modes
"""

wait 2000

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=center]
"""
Thank you for playing!

This demo showcases:
- Explore Mode
- Tactics Mode  
- Fight Mode
- Cutscene System
- PXSL Shaders
"""

wait 2500

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
THE END

...or is it just the beginning?
"""

@do playBgm [name=audio/opening.mp3]

wait 2000

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=1500]

waitInput

@end
